      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "With the other assumptions at base, the valuation is most sensitive to the cost of capital (one percentage point either way: a model value of ₹174 to ₹244 a share) and to how long WIPRO keeps earning high returns on new investment (anywhere from returns equal to its cost of capital to a quarter above its past level: a model value of ₹164 to ₹208 a share); the Q3 FY27 result will be the next reported quarter.",
